WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.030
This carton says pure orange juice.

2
00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:06.690
This beaker holds what looks
like plain, clear water.

3
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:09.390
But a spoonful of salt
was stirred into it,

4
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:12.210
and the salt seemed
to vanish completely.

5
00:00:12.260 --> 00:00:15.650
So, to a scientist, is
either of them pure?

6
00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:19.930
In science, the word pure
has a very exact meaning.

7
00:00:19.980 --> 00:00:23.070
In this mission, you'll find
out what a pure substance is,

8
00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:25.310
and what makes a mixture.

9
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:28.050
You'll see what really happens
when a solid dissolves,

10
00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:31.930
and how particles spread
out with no stirring at all.

11
00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:36.170
Your mission: decide if
clear salty water is pure.
